{"story":{"id":"anomaly-storms-displaced-tiyanki","title":{"zh":"走失的缇扬奇","en":"Displaced Tiyanki"},"category":"exploration","kind":"anomaly","image":"art/e4f1230f74621514f3e8.webp","start":"anomalies:STORMS_DISPLACED_TIYANKI","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我的探测器从宇宙风暴的余波中在[solar_system.GetName]星系发现了三个缇扬奇信号。","en":"In the aftermath of the Cosmic Storm our sensors have detected three Tiyanki signatures in the [solar_system.GetName] system."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"anomalies:STORMS_DISPLACED_TIYANKI","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"cstorms.5090","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/102_anomaly_categories_cosmic_storms.txt:323"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"special_projects:REUNITE_POD_PROJECT","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_cosmic_storms.txt:1092"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"cstorms.5095","parent":"n3","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/03_projects_cosmic_storms.txt:891"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"anomalies:STORMS_DISPLACED_TIYANKI","kind":"anomaly","title":{"zh":"走失的缇扬奇","en":"Displaced Tiyanki"},"texts":[{"zh":"我的探测器从宇宙风暴的余波中在[solar_system.GetName]星系发现了三个缇扬奇信号。","en":"In the aftermath of the Cosmic Storm our sensors have detected three Tiyanki signatures in the [solar_system.GetName] system."}],"sections":[{"zh":"我的探测器从宇宙风暴的余波中在[solar_system.GetName]星系发现了三个缇扬奇信号。","en":"In the aftermath of the Cosmic Storm our sensors have detected three Tiyanki signatures in the [solar_system.GetName] system."}],"image":"art/e4f1230f74621514f3e8.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"cstorms.5090","kind":"research","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/102_anomaly_categories_cosmic_storms.txt:323","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-storms-displaced-tiyanki"}],"source":{"file":"common/anomalies/102_anomaly_categories_cosmic_storms.txt","line":312}},{"id":"cstorms.5090","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"走失的缇扬奇","en":"Displaced Tiyanki"},"texts":[{"zh":"[solar_system.GetName]星系内的三只缇扬奇信号经过识别后发现是一伙流离失所、营养不良的幼崽。\n\n宇宙风暴将这些幼崽与它们的大群分开，迫使他们自力更生。\n\n它们看来不太可能在幽深的太空中存活太久。我们的传感器显示它们整在试图呼叫鲸群，但没有成功。","en":"The three Tiyanki signatures in the [solar_system.GetName] system have been identified as a set of displaced and malnourished calves.\n\nThe Cosmic Storm has separated these calves from their larger pod, leaving them to fend for themselves.\n\nThey are unlikely to survive for long in open space. Our sensors show they are attempting to call for their pod but are having no success."},{"zh":"","en":""},{"zh":"我们的通讯系统可以用来增强它们的呼救声，吸引它们的群体进入恒星系。","en":"Our communication systems could be used to boost their cries for help and attract their pod into the system."},{"zh":"","en":""},{"zh":"我们可以放大它们呼救的声音，把它们当作诱饵，引来一顿更大的大餐。","en":"We could boost their cries for help and use them as bait to draw in a larger feast."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/e4f1230f74621514f3e8.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"cstorms.5090.a.default","label":{"zh":"增强它们的信号。","en":"Boost their signal."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:REUNITE_POD_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_cosmic_storms.txt:1092","story":"anomaly-storms-displaced-tiyanki"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":false,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":false,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}}]],"labels":[{"label":{"zh":"增强它们的信号。","en":"Boost their signal."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"给陷阱下饵。","en":"Bait the trap."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]}],"sets":["displaced_tiyanki_hatchling"]},{"key":"cstorms.5090.b.default","label":{"zh":"大自然是残酷的。","en":"Nature is cruel."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"labels":[{"label":{"zh":"大自然是残酷的。","en":"Nature is cruel."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":false,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"启动灭绝方案。","en":"Begin extermination protocols."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":true,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"免费的大餐。","en":"A free meal."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]}]},{"key":"cstorms.5090.c","label":{"zh":"给它们一个新家","en":"Give them a new home."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"向你的['concept_vivarium']中增加3只随机稀有度的缇扬奇幼体","en":"Add 3 Tiyanki Hatchling of random rarity to your ['concept_vivarium']"}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_grand_archive_dlc","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"which","arg":"value:get_vivarium_slots_left","scope":"controller/check_variable_arithmetic","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"value","arg":"3","scope":"controller/check_variable_arithmetic","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_gravity_wells","scope":"controller","value":true,"label":{"zh":"重力陷阱","en":"Gravity Snares"}}]]}],"next":[{"target":"cstorms.320","kind":"sequence","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"sequence","source":"events/anomaly_events_cosmic_storms.txt:1174","hooks":["after"],"story":"origin_storm_chasers"}],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_cosmic_storms.txt","line":1001},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0},{"break":true},{"text":2,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"controller","value":false}]]},{"break":true},{"text":4,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"controller","value":true},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]}]}]},{"id":"special_projects:REUNITE_POD_PROJECT","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"重聚鲸群","en":"Reuniting the Pod"},"texts":[{"zh":"三只被宇宙风暴从鲸群中带丢的缇扬奇幼崽在[this.solar_system.GetName]星系游荡。我们可以通过放大它们的叫声来帮助它们把鲸群吸引到这个星系中来帮助它们重聚。","en":"Three Tiyanki calves are lost and wandering the [this.solar_system.GetName] system, separated from their pod by a cosmic storm. We can help reunite them with their pod by boosting their cries to attract the rest of their pod to the system."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/e4f1230f74621514f3e8.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"cstorms.5095","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/03_projects_cosmic_storms.txt:891","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-storms-displaced-tiyanki"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/03_projects_cosmic_storms.txt","line":876}},{"id":"cstorms.5095","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"缇扬奇重聚","en":"Tiyanki Reunited"},"texts":[{"zh":"缇扬奇的成兽在听到了三只幼崽被放大的叫声后，再度现身在[solar_system.GetName]星系中。\n\n年轻的缇扬奇重新回到了鲸群，现在已经恢复了快乐和健康。\n\n母鲸在我们的科研船附近留下了一大堆物质碎片，似乎是在感谢我们的帮助。令我们惊讶的是，这件奇怪的礼物中包含了好几种可用的材料。","en":"A Tiyanki cow and bull have both appeared in the [solar_system.GetName] system having heard the amplified cries of the three displaced calves.\n\nThe juvenile Tiyanki have been reintegrated back into their pod, and already appear much happier and healthier.\n\nThe cow has deposited a large mass of debris near our science vessel, seemingly as some kind of appreciation for our assistance. To our surprise this curious offering contains several usable materials."},{"zh":"","en":""},{"zh":"当然，这些大东西才是真正的猎物；我们已经准备好猎杀了。","en":"Of course, these larger beasts are the true prize; primed and ready for the slaughter."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/f1fd5f451f8e4555fcd8.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"FASCINATING","label":{"zh":"很迷人。","en":"Fascinating."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"labels":[{"label":{"zh":"很迷人。","en":"Fascinating."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"免费的大餐。","en":"A free meal."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]}]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_cosmic_storms.txt","line":1182},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0},{"break":true},{"text":2,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]}]}],"sets":["NAME_Tiyanki_Space_Whale"]}]}